  <item>
    <title>007 大厂“毕业”的令狐冲何去何从？聊金庸作品中的流浪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c881be35dd8780edb79065</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c881be35dd8780edb79065</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Feb 2024 08:13:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过年是漂泊旅人的人生锚点：即便一年到头流浪在外，也大多会在这时回到固定的地方，思索下一年又要往何处、追寻什么样的生活。我们在春节之际和大家聊一聊金庸笔下角色各自不同的流浪，和即将开启下一段漂泊旅程的你共温清酒、遥叙心事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 心疼“冲哥”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 离开“大厂”的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 郭襄的好奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> “闯荡江湖却走进死胡同”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 流浪让人变得不好惹？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a> 寻找流浪生活的确定支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> 片段分享：爆粗的风清扬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> 片段分享：自在游荡的郭襄</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期成员】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Olivia，啵啵</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Olivia，啵啵</span></p>]]></description>
