    <guid isPermaLink="false">65201c79a3b0404cbfb46be9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Oct 2023 14:40:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欲望与追求，幻灭与执着，痛苦与求索，本期与文学博士/普鲁斯特学者/Voiceover旁白的Olivia一起，打翻求不得这一人生大苦的五味杂陈，聊一聊这一主题在金庸作品中的展现。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 李莫愁的哲学家潜质与求不得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 令狐冲的追求不是强制爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 工具性之求与本质性之求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 郭襄与张三丰的求而不得与开阔人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 片段分享：少室山下小师妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> 片段分享：痛苦的令狐冲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 片段分享：李莫愁的BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> 片段分享：仪琳的愿望</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期成员】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Olivia，啵啵</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：啵啵</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
