  <item>
    <title>005 当韭菜也要了解的国际风云 | 从硅谷银行破产到国际格局变化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64526114306513184cf48b82</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64526114306513184cf48b82</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 May 2023 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>硅谷银行破产、伊朗沙特和解、俄乌战争、欧美通胀，纷繁复杂的国际新闻背后竟是一盘大棋？普通人该怎样在层出不穷的事件面前把握趋势，逃脱在麻木不仁与一惊一乍间的摇摆？</span></p><span></span><p><span>清华大学国际关系专业博士生烧卖将为我们解读热点新闻事件，勾勒事件背后所反映的国际关系格局的变化，让我们一窥国际关系学科“一叶知秋”的超能力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 硅谷银行破产与墨西哥移民洗碗工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 国际援助是过分理想主义吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> &nbsp;从世界银行到多边银行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> &nbsp;亚开行总部选址疑云</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a>“百亿补贴勋多多”究竟为何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 帮助普通人把握国际趋势的三个方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 中美国际关系学科的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关链接】</span></p><span></span><h1><span>Karen Karniol - Tambour on the Challenge of Investing in the Current Environment：<a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M-ro69efwz8" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M-ro69efwz8">www.youtube.com</a></span></h1><span></span><p><span>Credit Suisse Economics - War and Interest Rates：</span><a href="https://advisoranalyst.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/zoltan-pozsar-aug-2-war-and-interest-rates-1.pdf" data-url="https://advisoranalyst.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/zoltan-pozsar-aug-2-war-and-interest-rates-1.pdf"><span>zoltan-pozsar-aug-2-war-and-interest-rates-1.pdf (advisoranalyst.com)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Credit Suisse Economics - War and Industrial Policy：<a data-url="https://www.interest.co.nz/sites/default/files/2022-09/War%20%26%20industrial%20policy.pdf" href="https://www.interest.co.nz/sites/default/files/2022-09/War%20%26%20industrial%20policy.pdf">www.interest.co.nz</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期成员】</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：烧卖，清华大学国际关系专业博士生</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啵啵</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：小云云</span></p><span></span><p><span>【因为啵啵要赶着交论文而拖更了好久，感谢没有抛弃我们的小伙伴！以后会一直做下去！爱你们~】</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvKw1xL2i-nFeqOYk6MMVvh-r14j.m4a" length="32285865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqMzvlFSOq_DW5mwunFdRVAfWTk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>004 时光为何一去永不回？从时间哲学聊生活中的时间体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b036399acee6cd2f84e29f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b036399acee6cd2f84e29f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Dec 2022 13:16:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>辞旧迎新总让人感慨光阴似箭。 时间似乎总是不可逆转、不可改变地从过去流向未来。不管是对过去的怀念，还是对未来的憧憬，似乎都与这种熟悉又神秘的时间现象息息相关。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们该怎样理解时间不可逆的流逝？我们能从时间哲学中找到那些解释和启发呢？和我们一起加入这段探索时间的好奇之旅~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 张国荣和董浩叔叔是同龄人？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 怎样哲学地理解时光流逝？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> &nbsp;过去与未来有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> &nbsp;过去-未来是情绪的投射？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> &nbsp;时间流逝只是偶然现象？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> &nbsp;时间是实存的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1854">30:54</a> &nbsp;20后的周杰伦是90后的样板戏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1959">32:39</a> &nbsp;成为光子就可以使时间停滞？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【推荐阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《时间的秩序》 卡洛·罗韦利</span></p><span></span><p><span>《狭义与广义相对论浅说》 阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Your Brain Is a Time Machine: The Neuroscience and Physics of Time. </span></em><span>Dean Buonomano</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期成员】</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：啵啵，巴黎高师哲学专业博士</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小云云</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：啵啵</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr1WarUyZVq-vPzSL6AIeZIFBvfy.m4a" length="21866105" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqMzvlFSOq_DW5mwunFdRVAfWTk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>003 宏大叙事的注脚是意想不到-前流量记者讲故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/635cf5b3b55c9cee2ee1562c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">635cf5b3b55c9cee2ee1562c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Oct 2022 09:43:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>"如果不是亲眼所见，我可能都无法想象他们的工作"。 本期邀请到某知名栏目前采编记者/电影理论研究者明泽同学。日常极限挑战的浇筑工人，地震中的大力妈妈，工作强度大过996的乡支书……他将通过一个个故事向我们展示媒体上的宏大叙事在生活中的注脚，是怎样在看似平常中给我们带来震撼和意想不到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 九寨沟地震中的大力妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 记者的情绪消耗和情感触动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> &nbsp;对宏大叙事看法的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> &nbsp;凉山彝族自治州的拼命乡支书和绿鸡蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 记者的与人打交道小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 混凝土浇筑工人的极限工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期成员】</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：李明泽</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播/策划：啵啵</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：小云云，啵啵</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/likzB8n2LI8xiXhv9cUT2-HnX-Ty.m4a" length="57044686" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqMzvlFSOq_DW5mwunFdRVAfWTk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
